---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="eDiye Studio – Digital Product Studio & Web Presence — Dennis Essien"
  description="Designing the digital presence and brand identity for eDiye, a development studio focused on building purposeful digital products."
>
  <article class="project-detail">
    <div class="project-detail__inner">
      <a href="/work" class="project-detail__back">← Back to Work</a>

      <header class="project-detail__header">
        <div class="project-detail__tags">
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># Studio Brand</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># Web Presence</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># Product Strategy</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># UI/UX</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="project-detail__title">eDiye Studio</h1>
        <p class="project-detail__tagline">
          Website & app development studio — crafting a digital identity and interactive flagship communicating engineering capability with quiet confidence and radical clarity.
        </p>

        <div class="project-detail__meta">
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Client</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">eDiye Studio</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Role / Scope</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">Brand & Product Designer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Timeline</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">4 Weeks (2024)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Service</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">UI/UX & Web Development</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Full-Width Hero Visual Showcase -->
      <div class="project-detail__hero-showcase">
        <img 
          src="/images/projects/ediye.webp" 
          alt="eDiye Studio website and brand presentation overview"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- SECTION 1: PROJECT BRIEF -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge">
              <span>01 / Project Brief</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              Communicating technical capability with clarity and quiet confidence.
            </h2>
            <p>
              eDiye is a specialized digital product studio partnering with founders, fast-scaling startups, and enterprises to build resilient web applications and platforms. The studio's operating philosophy centers on "Clarity over clutter"—prioritizing deep engineering craft, intentional interfaces, and long-term maintainability over transient design fads.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our design objective was establishing a web presence and visual language that immediately sets eDiye apart in a saturated agency market: proving technical competence through understated typographic craft, fluid motion, and high-impact case study storytelling.
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Core Objective</h4>
                <p>Deliver an unmistakable studio presence that attracts discerning founders seeking high-craft design engineering and end-to-end product delivery.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Design Pillars</h4>
                <p>Restrained typography, responsive grid discipline, crisp micro-interactions, and transparent service offerings.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 2: THE PROBLEM -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge project-detail__badge--alert">
              <span>02 / The Problem</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              The noise of generic agency portfolios and opaque service positioning.
            </h2>
            <p>
              Agency and studio websites frequently suffer from interchangeable buzzwords, slow-loading 3D gimmicks that obscure real work, and ambiguous project attribution. Prospective clients struggle to evaluate what a studio actually built, how long it took, or what business outcome was achieved.
            </p>
            <p>
              Key friction points resolved in eDiye's repositioning:
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Vague Value Proposition</h4>
                <p>Prospective partners couldn't quickly discern whether eDiye focused on marketing branding, SaaS engineering, or Shopify development.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Case Study Superficiality</h4>
                <p>Previous agency presentations showcased decorative mockups without explaining the business constraints, engineering architecture, or UX problems solved.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Inquiry Friction</h4>
                <p>Complex multi-page briefing questionnaires deterred inbound founders on mobile devices who wanted a direct, low-friction channel to discuss project scope.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 3: THE SOLUTION & UX STRATEGY -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge project-detail__badge--success">
              <span>03 / The Solution</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              A content-first studio architecture: transparent service scopes, deep case study breakdowns, and direct founder engagement.
            </h2>
            <p>
              We established an editorial layout architecture that treats each case study as a masterclass in craft, while streamlining the inbound partnership funnel:
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 1: Transparent Service Modals</h4>
                <p>Clearly demarcated service offerings across Product Design, Shopify Flagships, and Custom Web Applications with explicit deliverables and timelines.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 2: Evidence-First Case Studies</h4>
                <p>Comprehensive problem-solution documentation detailing architectural choices, user metrics, and complete responsive screen galleries.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 3: High-Velocity Inbound Funnel</h4>
                <p>A streamlined, 3-field contact surface allowing founders to initiate conversations directly from any page without friction.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 4: IMPACT & KEY OUTCOMES -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge">
              <span>04 / Impact</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              High-value client inquiries and established studio authority.
            </h2>
            <p>
              The new eDiye web presence positioned the studio as a premier partner for founders across the US, Europe, and Africa, generating qualified inbound client leads within weeks of launch.
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__metrics-row">
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">3.2x</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Increase in High-Intent Project Inquiries</div>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">100%</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Clarity on Studio Capabilities & Scopes</div>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">&lt; 1.2s</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Global Edge-Loaded Performance Velocity</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PROJECT FOOTER NAVIGATION -->
      <nav class="project-detail__nav-footer" aria-label="Project pagination">
        <a href="/work/fragile-base">← Previous: Fragile Base</a>
        <a href="/work">All Selected Works</a>
        <a href="/work/xtoken">Next: xToken Terminal →</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
